# Sunroom Screen's few root tasks on this computer, through one helper that checks what it's asked
# (/usr/local/sbin/sunroom-kiosk-root: the browser's policy, the system's updates, Sunroom's
# update.sh). For the screen's user only, without a password, and nothing else.
@USER@ ALL=(root) NOPASSWD: /usr/local/sbin/sunroom-kiosk-root
